Up here at some price level, we'll call this P1, we have Q1 as our quantity. Down here we have some price, we'll call it P2 and our quantity will be Q2.

15
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:24,320
At price P1 we're going to have the elasticity of demand equal to 2 at P2 we're going to have the elasticity of demand be equal to 0.5.

16
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:31,240
Now let's raise the price on P1 to P3.

17
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:37,320
And you see the response is going to be Q1 to Q3.

